---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tier 1 Solar Panels | High Efficiency for Brisbane Homes">
  <main class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <nav class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-600 flex items-center gap-2">
          ← Back to Home
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
          Tier 1 Solar Panels: Why Quality Matters
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-12">
          Not all solar panels are created equal. In the harsh Australian sun, choosing Tier 1 hardware is the difference between a 25-year investment and a 5-year mistake.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
          <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What is "Tier 1"?</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Tier 1 is a ranking developed by Bloomberg New Energy Finance. It doesn't just mean "good quality"—it means the manufacturer is vertically integrated, invests heavily in R&D, and most importantly, is **bankable**. If they are still around in 25 years, your warranty is worth something.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Selected Brands</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600 font-medium">
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> Jinko Solar (Tiger Neo)
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> Q CELLS (Q.PEAK)
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> Canadian Solar
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> REC (Alpha Pure-R)
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Performance in Brisbane Heat</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
            Brisbane summers can be brutal. Standard panels lose efficiency as they get hotter. Our N-Type panels feature superior temperature coefficients, meaning they keep producing more power when you need it most (running the AC at 2 PM).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-orange-400">The 25-Year Guarantee</h2>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-white">Product Warranty</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Covers defects in materials and workmanship. Our premium panels offer 20-25 years.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-white">Performance Warranty</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Guarantees the panel will still produce ~85% of its original output after 25 years.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="text-center bg-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-12 border-2 border-orange-100">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready for a custom design?</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8">Every roof is different. Let us design a system that maximizes your specific orientation.</p>
          <a href="/#quote" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all">
            Get a Free Panel Layout
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
